### Get all products
GET https://localhost:7255/api/products

### Get parties (customers)
GET https://localhost:7255/api/parties?partyType=1&activeOnly=true

### Quick tax calculation
POST https://localhost:7255/api/tax/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerStateCode": "27",
  "placeOfSupplyStateCode": "29",
  "supplyCategory": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "description": "Laptop",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50000,
      "gstRate": 18
    }
  ]
}

### Dashboard
GET https://localhost:7255/api/reports/dashboard

### HSN search
GET https://localhost:7255/api/tax/hsn?search=laptop

### AI status
GET https://localhost:7255/api/chat/status

### AI chat (offline)
POST https://localhost:7255/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "GST on ₹5000 at 18% intra-state" }
  ]
}

### GSTR-1 CSV
GET https://localhost:7255/api/reports/gstr1/export.csv
